==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Toasty Hylian Shrooms are a variety of [[Roasted Food]], being the result of [[Hylian Shroom]]s that have been burnt by [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> They can also purchased from the [[Protein Palace]] in [[Goron City]] for 12 [[Rupee]]s. Toasty Hylian Shrooms have an amplified taste and fragrance compared to regular Hylian Shrooms.<ref name="Inventory"/> When eaten, they restore three-quarters of a [[Heart]] to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]].

